pve-storage-cetrafs (0.1.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Always mount with nofilelock, so live migration works.
  * Refuse unstable device paths (/dev/sdX, /dev/dm-N, ...) for
    cetrafs-device.
  * Report which node cannot see the device, and why, instead of the
    generic "storage is not online"; hint at multipathd for /dev/mapper.
  * README: one or several LUNs per target, target discovery, any block
    device, troubleshooting a node that does not mount.

 -- Massimo Cetra <mcetra@gmail.com>  Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:59:48 +0000

pve-storage-cetrafs (0.1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Load the cetrafs kernel module before mounting, so the storage mounts
    after a reboot.
  * README: step-by-step cetrafs over iSCSI setup.

 -- Massimo Cetra <mcetra@gmail.com>  Thu, 15 Oct 2026 20:10:58 +0000

